/// Returns the top category label based on a supplied grouping column and value expression
function TopByValue = ```
		
		    (
		        pGroup : ANYREF EXPR,
		        pValue : SCALAR VARIANT EXPR
		    ) =>
		    VAR __Summary =
		        ADDCOLUMNS(
		            ALL( pGroup ),
		            "__Metric", CALCULATE( pValue )
		        )
		    VAR __TopRow =
		        TOPN( 1, __Summary, [__Metric], DESC )
		    RETURN
		        MAXX( __TopRow, pGroup )
		```
